be equal to the square root

00:02.473 --> 00:05.644
of four x minus three,
and let c be the number

00:05.644 --> 00:08.692
that satisfies the mean
value theorem for f

00:08.692 --> 00:11.842
on the closed interval
between one and three,

00:11.842 --> 00:13.526
or one is less than or equal to x

00:13.526 --> 00:15.553
is less than or equal to three.

00:15.553 --> 00:16.386
What is c?

00:17.401 --> 00:20.169
So let's just remind ourselves
what it means for c to be

00:20.169 --> 00:23.644
the number that satisfies
the mean value theorem for f.

00:23.644 --> 00:27.171
This means that over this
interval, c is a point,

00:27.171 --> 00:30.305
x equals c is a point where
the slope of the tangent line

00:30.305 --> 00:34.873
at x equals c, so I
could write f prime of c,

00:34.873 --> 00:37.357
so that is the slope of the tangent line

00:37.357 --> 00:39.783
when x is equal to c, this is equal

00:39.783 --> 00:42.503
to the slope of the secant line

00:42.503 --> 00:45.031
that connects these two points.

00:45.031 --> 00:47.527
So this is going to be equal to,

00:47.527 --> 00:50.773
see the slope of the
secant line that connects

00:50.773 --> 00:54.773
the points three, f of
three, and one, f of one.

00:56.475 --> 01:00.225
So it's going to be f
of three minus f of one

01:01.231 --> 01:02.981
over three minus one.

01:05.005 --> 01:08.136
And if you wanted to think
about what this means visually,

01:08.136 --> 01:10.230
it would look something like this.

01:10.230 --> 01:12.236
So if this is our x axis

01:12.236 --> 01:13.986
and this is one, two,

01:16.691 --> 01:18.876
actually let me spread
it out a little bit more.

01:18.876 --> 01:20.543
One, two, and three.

01:22.493 --> 01:26.050
And so you have one, comma,
f of one, right over there,

01:26.050 --> 01:29.800
so that is at the point
one, comma, f of one,

01:30.733 --> 01:32.531
and we could evaluate that, actually,

01:32.531 --> 01:35.172
that's one, comma, one.

01:35.172 --> 01:38.847
So that's gonna be the
point one, comma, one.

01:38.847 --> 01:41.044
And then you have the point three, comma,

01:41.044 --> 01:44.139
let's see, you're gonna
have four times three is 12

01:44.139 --> 01:48.306
