one over three minus one,

04:35.181 --> 04:38.258
well that's gonna be two over
two, which is equal to one.

04:38.258 --> 04:41.019
So there's some point
between one and three

04:41.019 --> 04:43.632
where the derivative at that point,

04:43.632 --> 04:47.276
the slope of the tangent
line, is equal to one.

04:47.276 --> 04:50.332
So let's see if we can solve
this thing right over here.

04:50.332 --> 04:54.416
We can multiply both
sides of this by four c

04:54.416 --> 04:57.496
by the square root of four c minus three,

04:57.496 --> 04:59.774
and so then we are going to get

04:59.774 --> 05:03.941
two is equal to the square
root of four c minus three.

05:06.225 --> 05:08.310
All I did is multiply both sides of this

05:08.310 --> 05:10.121
by square root of four c minus three

05:10.121 --> 05:12.072
to get rid of this in the denominator,

05:12.072 --> 05:14.075
and so let's see, now we
