05:14.075 --> 05:16.541
we can square both sides, and so

05:16.541 --> 05:18.540
actually let me just show that,

05:18.540 --> 05:20.396
so now we can square both sides,

05:20.396 --> 05:24.229
so we get four is equal
to four c minus three,

05:26.516 --> 05:30.683
