and then divide both sides by four.

05:35.801 --> 05:37.944
I'll go right here to do it,

05:37.944 --> 05:40.485
you're going to get c is
equal to seven fourths.

05:40.485 --> 05:42.985
C is equal to seven over four,

05:44.748 --> 05:47.814
which is equal to one and three fourths,

05:47.814 --> 05:50.314
or we could view this as 1.75.

